- `__xdp_rxq_info_reg(&ring->xdp_rxq, ring->netdev, ring->q_index, ring->q_vector->napi.napi_id, ring->rx_buf_len);`
- `rx_buf_len = xsk_pool_get_rx_frame_size(ring->xsk_pool);` and then `__xdp_rxq_info_reg(&ring->xdp_rxq, ring->netdev, ring->q_index, ring->q_vector->napi.napi_id, rx_buf_len);`
